# 🚌 Bus Ticket Booking Database Management System

A complete SQL-based Bus Ticket Booking Database project developed using MySQL.  
This project demonstrates database creation, table relationships, ER modeling, and SQL queries for managing a bus reservation system.

## 📌 Project Overview

The Bus Ticket Booking Database helps manage:

- Passenger details
- Bus routes
- Bus schedules
- Ticket bookings
- Payments
- Seat allocation

This project is useful for learning:

- Database Management Systems (DBMS)
- SQL Queries
- ER Diagrams
- Relational Database Concepts
- Joins and Relationships

